# Final Model Evaluation Results

## Overview

This folder contains the final evaluation outputs generated from the Lassa fever machine learning forecasting and outbreak classification framework.

The results are based on the independent 2025 test dataset after model development and validation using earlier chronological observations.

## Regression Results

The regression models were evaluated using:

- Mean Absolute Error (MAE)
- Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE)
- Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE)
- Coefficient of Determination (R²)

### Final 2025 Regression Performance

| Model | MAE | RMSE | MAPE (%) | R² |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Support Vector Regressor | 6.3546 | 8.7611 | 45.9762 | 0.8148 |
| Linear Regression | 7.2465 | 9.4976 | 49.7240 | 0.7824 |
| XGBoost Regressor | 6.4808 | 9.7120 | 44.9871 | 0.7724 |
| Random Forest Regressor | 6.9055 | 10.4708 | 44.5906 | 0.7355 |

The Support Vector Regressor achieved the strongest overall forecasting performance based on MAE, RMSE, and R². The Random Forest Regressor recorded the lowest MAPE.

## Classification Results

Classification performance was assessed using:

- Accuracy
- Precision
- Recall
- F1-score
- ROC-AUC

### Final 2025 Classification Performance

| Model | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1-score | ROC-AUC |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Random Forest Classifier | 0.9038 | 0.8095 | 0.9444 | 0.8718 | 0.9673 |
| XGBoost Classifier | 0.9038 | 0.8095 | 0.9444 | 0.8718 | 0.9641 |
| Logistic Regression | 0.8462 | 0.6923 | 1.0000 | 0.8182 | 0.9542 |
| Support Vector Machine | 0.8077 | 0.6538 | 0.9444 | 0.7727 | 0.8971 |

Random Forest and XGBoost achieved the highest classification accuracy and F1-score, while Random Forest recorded the highest ROC-AUC.

## Result Files

The main output files in this folder include:

- `final_regression_test_results.csv`
- `final_classification_test_results.csv`

These files contain the final independent-test model evaluation metrics used in the project.
